  "title-post-2": "Sirha 2021 x Innovorder",
  "rt-blog-html": "\n          <h3>01. The context</h3>\n          <p><strong>The challenge of partnerships</strong></p>\n          <p>In 2021, Innovorder's ambition is to become <strong>a must-attend</strong> restaurant trade <strong>show</strong>. With the partnerships developed this year at <strong>Sirha</strong>, the world's leading food service event, we are strengthening our position in the digital transformation of the leaders in commercial, collective and concession catering.<br></p>\n          <h3>02. The interview</h3>\n          <p><strong>Watch the video</strong></p>\n          <p>Alexandre Milhomme, head of development at Innovorder, presents the ecosystem that the company has created with key players in the restaurant industry: the Institut Paul Bocuse and GL Events.</p>\n          <figure style=\"padding-bottom:56.206088992974244%\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-video\">\n            <div>\n              <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/H8mnTSfbJd0\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>\n            </div>\n          </figure>\n          <h4><strong>Why did you choose Innovorder?</strong></h4>\n          <p>\"Innovorder is an innovative technology, a welcome, people, listening, know-how and attention\" Bernard Ricolleau - Maître d'hôtel, Service and Tableware referent, Institut Paul Bocuse</p>\n          <figure style=\"max-width:1756px\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image\">\n            <div><img alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc59439219ff64_bocuse-kitchen-e1560514744910.webp\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <p><br></p>\n        ",
  "right-head": "SIRHA",
  "bozzolo-cat": "Collective catering",
  "div-html": "\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/online-ordering-for-restaurant\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc59e0dd1a0228_Commande%20en%20ligne.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Online Ordering</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/self-ordering-kiosk\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5975dd1a0229_Borne%20de%20commande.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Self Ordering Kiosk</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                ",
